<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nordstrom said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nordstrom said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds raised its rating on Nordstrom Inc to neutral from swap, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-5/8 at 42.</p>
</text>
